// Title: Potential Persistence Via Netsh Helper DLL - Registry
// Rule ID: c90362e0-2df3-4e61-94fe-b37615814cb1
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1546.007
// Category: registry_set
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_netsh_helper_dll_potential_persistence.yml
